1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,587
你把课程自己的代码原封不动地 push 到一个你自己的 repo
You push the course's own code, untouched, to a repository of your own.

2
00:00:04,907 --> 00:00:08,149
不久之后，有一份日志写着：unit tests，success
Soon after, one log says: unit tests, success.

3
00:00:08,469 --> 00:00:10,389
Integration tests，success
Integration tests, success.

4
00:00:10,709 --> 00:00:12,352
System tests，success
System tests, success.

5
00:00:12,672 --> 00:00:14,272
All tests passed
All tests passed.

6
00:00:15,017 --> 00:00:18,397
而同一个文件从头跑到尾，结尾是这样的
And the same file, run end to end, ends like this:

7
00:00:18,397 --> 00:00:20,628
job Lint and Format Check failed
job Lint and Format Check failed.

8
00:00:20,948 --> 00:00:24,297
五台机器绿，一台红，整个 run 是红的
Five machines green, one red, and the whole run red.

9
00:00:24,617 --> 00:00:28,372
这条 pipeline 说每个测试都通过了，而它自己失败了
The pipeline says every test passed, and the pipeline failed.

10
00:00:28,692 --> 00:00:30,017
两句都是真的
Both are true.

11
00:00:30,067 --> 00:00:33,374
那么，是哪台机器说了不，汇总又为什么没听见？
So which machine said no, and why didn't the summary hear it?

12
00:00:33,694 --> 00:00:36,958
到第一部分结束时，你会在自己的 push 上看到这一幕
By the end of part 1 you will see this on your own push.

13
00:00:37,278 --> 00:00:39,453
在第二部分，我们会打开每一份日志
In part 2 we open every log.

14
00:00:39,700 --> 00:00:43,561
在第 9 讲，这些检查是在你的笔记本上跑的，在 commit 之前
In lecture 9 these checks ran on your laptop, before a commit.

15
00:00:43,881 --> 00:00:48,081
今天它们搬到 GitHub 上，每次 push 到 main 都会运行
Today they move to GitHub, and they run on every push to main,

16
00:00:48,081 --> 00:00:50,452
跑在不属于任何人的全新机器上
on fresh machines that nobody owns.

17
00:00:50,700 --> 00:00:52,751
第 21 讲分四节
Lecture 21 has four sections:

18
00:00:52,751 --> 00:00:58,764
远程 Git hook、GitHub webhook、持续集成，以及持续部署
remote Git hooks, GitHub webhooks, continuous integration, and continuous deployment.

19
00:00:59,084 --> 00:01:03,500
我们一页一页地跟着课件走，一步一步地做 README 的 Part 5
We follow it slide by slide, and the README Part 5 step by step.

20
00:01:03,750 --> 00:01:08,181
要跟着做，你需要课程 repo 的一个新 clone
To follow along, you need a fresh clone of the course's repository,

21
00:01:08,181 --> 00:01:12,347
让 Docker 开着，一个 GitHub 账号，还有一个你自己的 repo
Docker running, a GitHub account, and a repository of your own.

22
00:01:12,667 --> 00:01:16,977
不用云，也不用密钥；在公开 repo 上，也不会有账单
No cloud and no keys, and on a public repository, no bill.

23
00:01:17,217 --> 00:01:22,039
进度条标出 README 的哪一步，代码面板标出文件和行号
The tracker names the README step, code panels name their file and lines,

24
00:01:22,039 --> 00:01:25,473
黄色的 your turn 标签表示暂停一下，自己跑一遍
and a yellow tag, your turn, means pause and run it.

25
00:01:25,793 --> 00:01:29,324
你会看到的 run，都是在这里的全新机器上真跑出来的
The runs you will see ran right here on fresh machines;

26
00:01:29,324 --> 00:01:32,342
GitHub 的页面是示意图，上面也都标明了
the GitHub pages are drawings, and they say so.

27
00:01:33,483 --> 00:01:36,619
课上先做了个回顾：本地 Git hook
The lecture opens with a recap: local Git hooks.

28
00:01:36,939 --> 00:01:39,300
一个 pre-commit hook 在你的笔记本上运行
A pre-commit hook runs on your laptop,

29
00:01:39,300 --> 00:01:41,163
那时 commit 还根本不存在
before the commit even exists.

30
00:01:41,483 --> 00:01:44,333
一个 pre-push hook 会在你的 commit 离开之前运行
A pre-push hook runs before your commits leave.

31
00:01:44,576 --> 00:01:47,435
在第 9 讲，你装过这个 repo 的那一套
In lecture 9 you installed this repo's set.

32
00:01:47,683 --> 00:01:51,181
这里是那条链，换成了这个 repo 的方框
Here is that chain, with this repo's boxes:

33
00:01:51,181 --> 00:01:54,923
七项卫生检查，然后是 Black，然后是 Flake8
seven hygiene checks, then Black, then Flake8,

34
00:01:54,923 --> 00:01:58,990
都是 120 列，而且只查 src 下的文件
both at 120 columns, and only on files under src/.

35
00:01:59,310 --> 00:02:01,336
课上那条链最后是测试
The lecture's chain ends with tests.

36
00:02:01,656 --> 00:02:05,198
这个 repo 的 hook 一个测试都不跑：它把测试留给了 CI
This repo's hooks run none: it leaves the tests to CI.

37
00:02:05,433 --> 00:02:06,662
课上指出的问题是
The lecture's catch:

38
00:02:06,662 --> 00:02:10,617
hook 只在有人跑过 pre-commit install 的机器上运行
hooks run only on a machine where someone ran pre-commit install.

39
00:02:10,937 --> 00:02:14,777
队友的笔记本没装它们，commit 就没经过检查直接发出去了
A teammate's laptop without them sends its commit through unchecked.

40
00:02:15,097 --> 00:02:17,102
所以检查做不做，取决于是哪台笔记本
So the checks depend on the laptop.

41
00:02:17,350 --> 00:02:21,659
这时就轮到远程 hook 了：它们运行在接收 push 的服务器上
That's where remote hooks come in: they run on the server that receives the push.

42
00:02:21,979 --> 00:02:24,981
一个 pre-receive hook 在 push 被接受之前运行
A pre-receive hook runs before the push is accepted,

43
00:02:24,981 --> 00:02:26,581
所以它可以拒绝这次 push
so it can refuse it.

44
00:02:26,801 --> 00:02:29,979
名叫 update 的 hook 也一样，只是一次一个分支
The update hook does the same, one branch at a time.

45
00:02:30,216 --> 00:02:33,344
一个 post-receive hook 在代码进来之后运行
A post-receive hook runs after the code is in,

46
00:02:33,344 --> 00:02:36,744
用来跑集成测试，发通知和清理
for integration tests, notifications and clean-up.

47
00:02:37,064 --> 00:02:39,774
它能报告，但已经没法说不了
It can report, but it can no longer say no.

48
00:02:40,016 --> 00:02:41,116
如实说一句
One honest note:

49
00:02:41,116 --> 00:02:44,688
GitHub.com 不会运行你自己写的 pre-receive 脚本
GitHub.com doesn't run your own pre-receive scripts.

50
00:02:45,008 --> 00:02:47,082
它给你的是另外两样东西
It gives you two pieces instead:

51
00:02:47,082 --> 00:02:52,006
Actions，在 push 之后运行；还有分支保护，它能说不
Actions, which runs after the push, and branch protection, which can say no.

52
00:02:52,250 --> 00:02:54,341
而且 hook 只在 Git 内部起作用
And hooks act only inside Git.

53
00:02:54,661 --> 00:02:58,223
要告诉聊天工具发生了什么，课上用的是 webhook
To tell a chat what happened, the lecture reaches for webhooks.

54
00:02:58,466 --> 00:03:01,453
接下来是课上的动机，用了三页课件
Now the lecture's motivation, in three slides.

55
00:03:01,773 --> 00:03:04,695
在你的笔记本上，每次 commit 都会触发检查
On your laptop, the checks fire on every commit.

56
00:03:05,015 --> 00:03:09,432
然后你 push 了，到了共享的 repo 上，根本没有东西去跑它们
Then you push, and on the shared repository, nothing runs them at all.

57
00:03:09,666 --> 00:03:15,021
所以检查搬到了服务器上：构建 container，检查代码，汇总测试
So the checks move to the server: build a container, check the code, summarize the tests.

58
00:03:15,341 --> 00:03:16,841
想法不变，只是换了个家
Same idea, new home,

59
00:03:16,841 --> 00:03:19,501
每台笔记本每次 push 到 main，都会跑
for every push to main from every laptop.

60
00:03:19,821 --> 00:03:22,146
这一步搬家，就是持续集成
That move is continuous integration.

61
00:03:24,317 --> 00:03:28,598
课上把持续集成定义为一系列脚本
The lecture defines continuous integration as a series of scripts

62
00:03:28,598 --> 00:03:31,826
只要代码一变，它们就自动运行
that run automatically whenever the code changes.

63
00:03:32,146 --> 00:03:34,674
它们持续地集成变更
They integrate changes continuously,

64
00:03:34,674 --> 00:03:39,592
自动测试，强制执行编码规范，还做静态分析
test automatically, enforce coding standards, and run static analysis.

65
00:03:39,834 --> 00:03:45,253
在普通软件里，这换来的是发布更快、代码更好、协作更容易
In ordinary software, that buys faster releases, better code, and easier teamwork.

66
00:03:45,573 --> 00:03:49,156
机器学习会带来一个转折；我们最后再回来讲
Machine learning adds a twist; we come back to it at the end.

67
00:03:49,400 --> 00:03:51,725
课件第 21 页把它画成一个循环
Slide 21 draws it as a loop.

68
00:03:52,045 --> 00:03:55,915
开发者把代码 commit 到代码库
Developers commit to the codebase; the codebase is built,

69
00:03:55,915 --> 00:03:57,952
代码库先构建，再测试
then tested; and notifications

70
00:03:57,952 --> 00:03:59,853
通知再流回开发者
flow back to the developers.

71
00:04:00,173 --> 00:04:02,670
现在，回来的那条路还是个问号
For now, the way back is a question mark.

72
00:04:02,917 --> 00:04:05,285
课程的 pipeline 有五个阶段
The course's pipeline has five stages.

73
00:04:05,605 --> 00:04:07,862
一个 commit 触发它，构建 container
A commit triggers it, the container

74
00:04:07,862 --> 00:04:13,861
Black 和 Flake8 检查代码，跑测试，最后汇总报告通过还是失败
is built, Black and Flake8 check the code, the tests run, and a summary reports pass or fail.

75
00:04:14,100 --> 00:04:18,111
现在看 README 的 Part 5：GitHub Actions，Remote CI
Now the README, Part 5: GitHub Actions, remote CI.

76
00:04:18,431 --> 00:04:23,059
它说所有 CI 测试都在 Docker container 里跑
It says all CI tests run inside Docker containers using

77
00:04:23,059 --> 00:04:26,089
用 Python 3.11，和生产环境一样
Python 3.11, the same as production.

78
00:04:26,409 --> 00:04:31,380
这个 repo 还没有生产环境：就把它理解成你要部署的那个 image
This repo has no production yet: take it as the same image you would deploy.

79
00:04:31,617 --> 00:04:35,777
这一步 README 里没有，是额外的：列出 workflows 目录
This one isn't in the README, it's extra: list the workflows folder.

80
00:04:36,097 --> 00:04:37,597
只有一个文件 ci.yml
One file, ci.yml,

81
00:04:37,597 --> 00:04:41,942
在 repo 根目录的 .github/workflows 里
in .github/workflows, at the root of the repository.

82
00:04:42,262 --> 00:04:46,316
GitHub 只看那里；放在子目录里的工作流永远不会运行
GitHub looks only there; a workflow in a subfolder never runs.

83
00:04:46,550 --> 00:04:51,009
打开它。文件给工作流起了个名字：CI Pipeline
Open it. The file gives the workflow a name, CI Pipeline.

84
00:04:51,329 --> 00:04:54,209
接下来是名叫 on 的那个键，就是 on 这个词
Next comes the key called on, just the word on.

85
00:04:54,529 --> 00:04:56,875
它列出了启动这个工作流的事件
It lists the events that start the workflow.

86
00:04:57,195 --> 00:05:00,200
在 jobs 下面，每个 job 都有自己的机器
Under jobs, each job gets its own machine,

87
00:05:00,200 --> 00:05:03,062
叫作 runner：runs-on: ubuntu-latest
called a runner: runs-on: ubuntu-latest.

88
00:05:03,300 --> 00:05:05,732
在一个 job 里，步骤按顺序运行
Inside a job, steps run in order.

89
00:05:06,052 --> 00:05:09,093
步骤要么是 shell 脚本，在 run 下面
A step is either a shell script, under run,

90
00:05:09,093 --> 00:05:10,593
要么是可复用的 action
or a reusable action,

91
00:05:10,593 --> 00:05:13,006
在 uses 下面，比如 actions/checkout
under uses, like actions/checkout,

92
00:05:13,006 --> 00:05:16,271
它把你的 repo 拷到机器上
which copies your repository onto the machine.

93
00:05:16,591 --> 00:05:20,154
事件、工作流、job、步骤：这就是全部的语法
Event, workflow, jobs, steps: that is the whole grammar.

94
00:05:21,300 --> 00:05:23,092
这条 pipeline 什么时候会醒来？
When does the pipeline wake up?

95
00:05:23,412 --> 00:05:26,377
课件说每次 push 或 PR 都会
The slide says on every push or pull request.

96
00:05:26,697 --> 00:05:30,294
文件写得更精确：push 到 main 或 develop
The file is more precise: pushes to main or develop,

97
00:05:30,294 --> 00:05:32,991
以及合并进 main 或 develop 的 PR
and pull requests into main or develop.

98
00:05:33,233 --> 00:05:35,505
往 main 上 push，就有一台 runner 醒来
Push to main, and a runner wakes up.

99
00:05:35,772 --> 00:05:37,405
往 develop 上 push，也一样
Push to develop, the same.

100
00:05:37,692 --> 00:05:40,363
往 feature 分支上 push，什么也不会发生
Push to a feature branch, and nothing happens:

101
00:05:40,363 --> 00:05:43,964
在其他任何分支上，这条 pipeline 都会等你的 PR
on any other branch, the pipeline waits for your pull request.

102
00:05:44,284 --> 00:05:48,380
说明一点：文件顶上的注释说只有 main
A small note: the comment at the top of the file says main only;

103
00:05:48,380 --> 00:05:50,556
触发条件写的却是 main 和 develop
the triggers say main and develop.

104
00:05:50,800 --> 00:05:54,590
小测验。你往 feature/login 上 push 了三个 commit
Quick test. You push three commits to feature/login.

105
00:05:54,747 --> 00:05:56,339
会启动几个 run？
How many runs start?

106
00:05:56,389 --> 00:05:58,715
然后你开了一个合并进 main 的 PR
Then you open a pull request into main.

107
00:05:59,035 --> 00:06:00,635
现在呢？
How many now?

108
00:06:08,883 --> 00:06:11,716
那三次 push，一个 run 也不会启动：因为有分支过滤
None for the three pushes: the branch filter.

109
00:06:11,976 --> 00:06:17,075
PR 打开时一次，之后它开着的时候，每 push 一次再加一次
One when the pull request opens, and one more for every later push while it stays open.

110
00:06:17,317 --> 00:06:19,300
而且它测的不是你分支最新的 commit
And it doesn't test your branch tip.

111
00:06:19,493 --> 00:06:23,135
GitHub 会把你的分支临时合并进 main
GitHub makes a temporary merge of your branch into main,

112
00:06:23,135 --> 00:06:26,256
job 看到的 commit ID 指的就是这次合并
and the commit ID the jobs see names that merge.

113
00:06:26,576 --> 00:06:31,567
将要合进去的，就是被测试的：每次合并都会被测试，正如课上说的
What will land is what gets tested: each merge is tested, as the lecture says.

114
00:06:31,817 --> 00:06:35,145
课上提醒，频繁集成要花算力
The lecture warns that integrating often costs compute.

115
00:06:35,465 --> 00:06:40,116
这个文件的回答是：分支过滤，所有 job 共用的一次构建
This file answers with a branch filter, one build shared by every job,

116
00:06:40,116 --> 00:06:41,844
还有只保留一天的 image
and an image kept one day.

117
00:06:42,164 --> 00:06:47,582
在私有 repo 上，每个 run 都计入你的套餐额度；公开的免费
On private repositories every run counts against your plan; public ones run free.

118
00:06:47,817 --> 00:06:49,073
而且时机很重要
And timing matters:

119
00:06:49,073 --> 00:06:52,446
run 是在 GitHub 接受了你的 push 之后才开始的
the run starts after GitHub has accepted your push.

120
00:06:52,766 --> 00:06:56,435
它是铃，不是门禁：一个红的 run 撤销不了这次 push
It's the bell, not the gate: a red run doesn't undo the push.

121
00:06:57,583 --> 00:07:02,810
接下来看 README：6 个并行运行的 job，有依赖的除外
Next, the README: 6 jobs that run in parallel, except for dependencies.

122
00:07:03,130 --> 00:07:04,969
每个都有一个 ID 和一个名字
Each has an ID and a name:

123
00:07:04,969 --> 00:07:08,788
Build Docker Image、Lint and Format Check、Unit Tests
Build Docker Image, Lint and Format Check, Unit Tests,

124
00:07:08,788 --> 00:07:12,324
Integration Tests、System Tests 和 Test Summary
Integration Tests, System Tests, and Test Summary.

125
00:07:12,566 --> 00:07:15,054
记住这些名字：GitHub 显示的是名字
Remember the names: GitHub shows them,

126
00:07:15,054 --> 00:07:18,262
不是 ID，而保护 main 的时候要用到它们
not the IDs, and we'll need them to protect main.

127
00:07:18,500 --> 00:07:20,548
从课上那一排五个方框开始
Start from the lecture's row of five.

128
00:07:20,868 --> 00:07:24,068
Commit 先退出：它是事件，不是 job
Commit drops out first: it's the event, not a job.

129
00:07:24,388 --> 00:07:27,758
Build Container 留在左边：它就是 build 这个 job
Build Container stays on the left: it's the build job.

130
00:07:28,000 --> 00:07:30,389
现在，每一行 needs 画出一条箭头
Now each needs line draws one arrow.

131
00:07:30,709 --> 00:07:32,832
先看 lint and format，它需要 build
Lint and format needs build.

132
00:07:32,928 --> 00:07:37,451
三个测试 job 也各自需要 build
Unit tests, integration tests and system tests each need build too.

133
00:07:37,771 --> 00:07:42,698
所以 build 之后，四个 job 并排运行，各在自己的机器上
So after the build, four jobs run side by side, each on its own machine.

134
00:07:42,933 --> 00:07:45,557
Test Summary 需要三个测试 job
Test summary needs the three test jobs.

135
00:07:45,877 --> 00:07:48,842
仔细看：lint 这个 job 不在那张列表上
Look closely: the lint job isn't on that list.

136
00:07:49,162 --> 00:07:51,727
课上按顺序列出各个阶段
The lecture lists the stages in order;

137
00:07:51,727 --> 00:07:57,397
在 GitHub 上，其中四个并排运行，而汇总只听测试 job 的
on GitHub, four of them run side by side, and the summary listens only to the tests.

138
00:07:57,717 --> 00:07:59,317
把这个缺口记在心里
Keep that gap in mind.

139
00:07:59,450 --> 00:08:02,924
一个额外检查，README 里没有：一个叫 act 的工具
An extra check, not in the README: a tool called act,

140
00:08:02,924 --> 00:08:07,578
你用不着它，它拿同一个文件，把 job 按阶段列出来
which you don't need, takes the same file and lists the jobs in stages.

141
00:08:07,898 --> 00:08:09,498
第 0 阶段，build
Stage 0, build.

142
00:08:09,669 --> 00:08:11,503
第 1 阶段，四个检查
Stage 1, the four checks.

143
00:08:11,823 --> 00:08:13,423
第 2 阶段，汇总
Stage 2, the summary.

144
00:08:13,583 --> 00:08:15,183
然后是关键概念
Then the key concepts.

145
00:08:15,311 --> 00:08:19,574
Artifact 共享和唯一的 image tag 跟着 build 讲
Artifact sharing and unique image tags come with the build job;

146
00:08:19,574 --> 00:08:21,807
并行执行，你刚刚看到了
parallel execution, you just saw;

147
00:08:21,807 --> 00:08:26,340
条件执行和网络模式跟着系统测试讲
conditional execution and network modes come with the system tests.

148
00:08:26,583 --> 00:08:29,239
README 的截图给出了时间
The README's screenshot gives the times:

149
00:08:29,239 --> 00:08:33,090
实际大约 2 分钟，四个 job 并排运行
about 2 minutes on the clock, with four jobs side by side.

150
00:08:33,410 --> 00:08:38,147
在私有 repo 上，每个 job 都单独计费、单独取整
On a private repository, each job is billed and rounded up separately:

151
00:08:38,147 --> 00:08:39,747
大约 6 分钟的计费时间
about 6 billed minutes.

152
00:08:40,850 --> 00:08:42,208
该 push 了
Time to push.

153
00:08:42,258 --> 00:08:45,457
从一个新的 clone 开始，别用你第 9 讲的目录
Start from a fresh clone, not your lecture 9 folder:

154
00:08:45,457 --> 00:08:47,733
那个目录里已经 commit 了 Black 的修复
that one has the Black fix committed,

155
00:08:47,733 --> 00:08:50,194
你的第一个 run 会是绿的
and your first run would come out green.

156
00:08:50,514 --> 00:08:54,695
先 clone，进到目录里，git status 显示工作区是干净的
Clone, change into the folder, and git status says the tree is clean.

157
00:08:58,600 --> 00:09:00,435
你的提示符显示的是你自己的用户
Your prompt shows your own user.

158
00:09:00,755 --> 00:09:02,243
先做两个额外检查
Two extra checks first:

159
00:09:02,243 --> 00:09:06,838
pin 住的 commit 仍然是课程 repo 上 main 的最新 commit
the pinned commit is still the head of main on the course's repository,

160
00:09:06,838 --> 00:09:10,333
而且最后两个 commit 都叫 demo class 1
and the last two commits are both called demo class 1.

161
00:09:10,653 --> 00:09:14,216
第二个撤销了课上埋下的一个 bug；我们后面会跑它
The second undid a bug planted in class; we'll run it later.

162
00:09:14,450 --> 00:09:16,794
现在是 README 的那一段：Push to GitHub
Now the README block, Push to GitHub.

163
00:09:17,095 --> 00:09:18,909
先是 git add . —— 没有输出
git add . — no output.

164
00:09:19,229 --> 00:09:22,365
然后是 git commit -m "Add CI pipeline"
Then git commit -m "Add CI pipeline".

165
00:09:22,685 --> 00:09:26,141
而 Git 的回答是：nothing to commit, working tree clean
And Git answers: nothing to commit, working tree clean.

166
00:09:26,383 --> 00:09:29,863
有一个小疏漏，而且无害：在 clone 或 fork 里
A small slip, and a harmless one: in a clone or a fork,

167
00:09:29,863 --> 00:09:33,786
pipeline 早就 commit 过了，所以没什么可加的
the pipeline is already committed, so there is nothing to add.

168
00:09:34,033 --> 00:09:36,151
在 README 的 git push 之前
Before the README's git push,

169
00:09:36,151 --> 00:09:38,342
先做一个额外检查：git remote -v
an extra check: git remote -v.

170
00:09:38,662 --> 00:09:42,844
这里的 origin 还是课程的 repo，你没有写权限
Origin is still the course's repository, and you can't write to it.

171
00:09:43,164 --> 00:09:46,449
GitHub 会拒绝从这里发出的 push：permission denied
GitHub would refuse a push from here: permission denied.

172
00:09:46,683 --> 00:09:49,584
所以把 origin 指向一个你自己的 repo
So point origin at a repository you own.

173
00:09:49,904 --> 00:09:55,378
要么 fork 课程的 repo 再到它的 Actions 标签页启用工作流
Either fork the course's repository and enable workflows on its Actions tab,

174
00:09:55,378 --> 00:09:57,755
要么新建一个空 repo
or create a new empty repository.

175
00:09:58,075 --> 00:09:59,312
不管选哪个，都运行
Either way,

176
00:09:59,312 --> 00:10:02,576
git remote set-url origin，后面跟你自己的地址
run git remote set-url origin, with your own address.

177
00:10:02,896 --> 00:10:04,496
暂停一下，把你的设置好
Pause and set yours up.

178
00:10:07,683 --> 00:10:10,534
录制用的这台机器没法 push 到 GitHub
This recording machine can't push to GitHub,

179
00:10:10,534 --> 00:10:14,616
所以由同一台机器上的一个空 repo 代替你的
so an empty repository on the same machine stands in for yours.

180
00:10:14,936 --> 00:10:17,710
从现在起，我们就说你的 repo
From now on we just say your repository.

181
00:10:17,950 --> 00:10:19,550
现在是 README 的 git push
Now the README's git push.

182
00:10:19,870 --> 00:10:21,709
显示 new branch，main 到 main
New branch, main -> main.

183
00:10:21,854 --> 00:10:24,734
这次 push 就是事件，run 1 现在开始
This push is the event, and run 1 starts now.

184
00:10:25,054 --> 00:10:26,654
暂停一下，push 你自己的
Pause and push yours.

185
00:10:27,300 --> 00:10:30,033
在 fork 上，这个 commit 已经在 GitHub 上
On a fork, that commit is already on GitHub,

186
00:10:30,033 --> 00:10:33,636
所以 git push 显示 Everything up-to-date，什么也不启动
so git push says Everything up-to-date and starts nothing.

187
00:10:33,956 --> 00:10:37,138
想照样得到 run 1，就 push 一个空 commit
To get run 1 anyway, push an empty commit:

188
00:10:37,138 --> 00:10:41,380
git commit --allow-empty -m "Trigger CI"，然后 git push
git commit --allow-empty -m "Trigger CI", then git push.

189
00:10:41,700 --> 00:10:45,519
或者等一等，你的第一个 run 会跟着第二部分的修复到来
Or wait, and your first run then comes with the fix in part 2.

190
00:10:46,867 --> 00:10:51,710
看 GitHub Actions：打开你的 repo，点 Actions 标签页
Watch GitHub Actions: go to your repository, and click the Actions tab.

191
00:10:52,030 --> 00:10:56,766
你的 run 列在 commit 信息下面，带一个黄点：进行中
Your run is listed under the commit message, with a yellow dot: in progress.

192
00:10:57,086 --> 00:11:00,819
绿色的对勾表示成功；红叉表示失败
A green checkmark means success; a red X means failure.

193
00:11:01,139 --> 00:11:02,739
暂停一下，打开你自己的
Pause and open yours.

194
00:11:02,934 --> 00:11:07,287
点开它，GitHub 会把这个 run 画成你刚搭出来的那张图
Click it, and GitHub draws the run as the graph you just built:

195
00:11:07,287 --> 00:11:11,019
先是 build，四个 job 并排，最后是汇总
build first, four jobs side by side, the summary last.

196
00:11:11,267 --> 00:11:12,867
说一下我们是怎么展示的
A word on how we show it.

197
00:11:13,187 --> 00:11:15,885
这个文件的每个 job，我们都在这里跑过
We ran every job of this file right here,

198
00:11:15,885 --> 00:11:20,163
每个都在一台 Docker 是空的全新机器上，和 GitHub 一样
each on a brand-new machine with an empty Docker, as GitHub does.

199
00:11:20,483 --> 00:11:25,006
还有一个叫 act 的工具，用第二种方式跑了整个文件，结论相同
And a tool called act ran the whole file a second way, with the same verdict.

200
00:11:25,250 --> 00:11:26,888
所以你看到的 GitHub 页面
So the GitHub pages you see

201
00:11:26,888 --> 00:11:30,711
是按工作流文件画的示意图，标着 illustration
are drawings built from the workflow file, marked illustration.

202
00:11:31,031 --> 00:11:32,973
里面每一行日志都是真的
Every log line in them is real.

203
00:11:33,217 --> 00:11:35,457
颜色出来之前，先问一个问题
A question, before the colors come in.

204
00:11:35,777 --> 00:11:37,782
你已经知道这个 run 会变红
You already know this run turns red.

205
00:11:38,102 --> 00:11:40,982
你的 push 现在在你 repo 的 main 上吗
Is your push on main in your repository now,

206
00:11:40,982 --> 00:11:42,881
还是被这个红的 run 拒绝了？
or did the red run refuse it?

207
00:11:51,717 --> 00:11:55,846
在，它在 main 上：push 在任何 job 开始之前就落地了
Yes, it's on main: the push landed before any job started,

208
00:11:55,846 --> 00:11:57,840
一个红的 run 撤销不了它
and a red run can't undo it.

209
00:11:58,160 --> 00:11:59,731
Build：绿
Build: green.

210
00:11:59,781 --> 00:12:01,872
Lint and Format Check：红
Lint and Format Check: red.

211
00:12:02,192 --> 00:12:04,944
三个测试和 Test Summary：绿
The three tests and Test Summary: green.

212
00:12:05,264 --> 00:12:06,784
整个 run：红
The run: red.

213
00:12:06,834 --> 00:12:11,293
你 commit 旁边的那些对勾和叉，就是课上说的通知
Those checks and crosses next to your commit are the lecture's notifications.

214
00:12:11,613 --> 00:12:16,284
而第二个证人 act 也同意：五个 job 成功，一个失败
And act, the second witness, agrees: five jobs succeeded, one failed.

215
00:12:16,534 --> 00:12:19,734
提一句：README 的截图是全绿的
A kind note: the README's screenshot is all green.

216
00:12:20,054 --> 00:12:22,337
它拍的是早先版本的代码
It shows an earlier version of the code.

217
00:12:22,657 --> 00:12:25,984
你的第一个 run 是红的，在第二部分里，你会把它变绿
Your first run is red, and in part 2 you turn it green.

218
00:12:26,234 --> 00:12:28,763
开头那个谜题，就出现在你自己的 push 上
And here is the hook, on your own push:

219
00:12:28,763 --> 00:12:31,034
这六台机器里有两台意见不一
two of these six machines disagree.

220
00:12:31,354 --> 00:12:34,852
在第二部分，我们会打开每一份日志，一次一个 job
In part 2 we open every log, one job at a time.

221
00:12:36,200 --> 00:12:38,099
第二部分，逐个 job 看
Part 2, job by job.

222
00:12:38,419 --> 00:12:41,875
先看构建 container：课上把它放在最前面
First, build container: the lecture builds it first,

223
00:12:41,875 --> 00:12:47,059
这样每个检查都在同一个环境里运行，构建的问题也能尽早暴露
so every check runs in the same environment, and build problems show up early.

224
00:12:47,300 --> 00:12:49,924
课上说的是一台远程 CI 服务器
The lecture speaks of one remote CI server.

225
00:12:50,244 --> 00:12:53,226
GitHub 给每个 job 一台新的
GitHub gives you a new one for every job:

226
00:12:53,226 --> 00:12:56,644
这个文件里六次写着 runs-on: ubuntu-latest
runs-on: ubuntu-latest, six times in this file.

227
00:12:56,964 --> 00:12:59,183
每个 job 都从一台空机器开始
Each job starts on an empty machine.

228
00:12:59,467 --> 00:13:02,428
README 里 build 这个 job 只构建一次 image
The README's build job builds the image once,

229
00:13:02,428 --> 00:13:04,139
用 commit ID 打 tag
tagged with the commit ID.

230
00:13:04,459 --> 00:13:08,350
它把 image 存成一个 tar 文件，作为 artifact 上传
It saves it as a tar file and uploads it as an artifact,

231
00:13:08,350 --> 00:13:11,477
这样其他每个 job 拿到的都是完全相同的 image
so every other job gets the exact same image.

232
00:13:11,717 --> 00:13:15,152
在 GitHub 上，点一个 job，再点一个步骤，就能打开它的日志
On GitHub, click a job, then a step, to open its log.

233
00:13:15,472 --> 00:13:18,958
Docker 用 Dockerfile 构建 image
Docker builds the image from the Dockerfile,

234
00:13:18,958 --> 00:13:22,128
把它命名为 cheese-app-api，冒号，再加 commit ID
and names it cheese-app-api:<commit ID>.

235
00:13:22,448 --> 00:13:25,370
这个 tag 只表示这个 commit 的 image，别的都不是
That tag means this commit's image, nothing else.

236
00:13:25,617 --> 00:13:28,997
有一个小疏漏：README 说有 Buildx 缓存
A small slip: the README promises Buildx caching,

237
00:13:28,997 --> 00:13:33,756
但构建用的是默认的构建器，也没有东西保存缓存
but the build runs on the default builder, and nothing saves a cache,

238
00:13:33,756 --> 00:13:36,860
所以每台全新的机器都从头重建
so every fresh machine rebuilds from scratch.

239
00:13:37,180 --> 00:13:38,822
练习里讲了怎么加
The exercises show how.

240
00:13:39,067 --> 00:13:44,571
用 docker save 把 image 打成一个文件，大约 176 MB
docker save folds the image into one file, about 176 megabytes.

241
00:13:44,891 --> 00:13:48,838
上传那一步把它送进 artifact 存储，保留一天
The upload step carries it to the artifact store, kept for one day.

242
00:13:49,158 --> 00:13:51,077
然后构建用的机器就被扔掉了
Then the build machine is thrown away.

243
00:13:51,317 --> 00:13:53,322
现在进到一个全新的检查 job 里
Now step into a fresh check job.

244
00:13:53,642 --> 00:13:57,120
一条额外的命令 docker images，只显示了表头
An extra command, docker images, shows just the header.

245
00:13:57,440 --> 00:13:58,883
一个 image 也没有
No image at all.

246
00:13:58,933 --> 00:14:02,680
所以每个检查 job 都要下载 artifact
So every check job downloads the artifact and runs

247
00:14:02,680 --> 00:14:04,628
再对这个 tar 跑 docker load -i
docker load -i on the tar:

248
00:14:04,628 --> 00:14:07,701
同一个 tag，从行李箱里拆出来
the same tag, unpacked from the suitcase.

249
00:14:08,021 --> 00:14:09,621
这就是 artifact 共享
That's artifact sharing.

250
00:14:09,877 --> 00:14:12,278
而且 artifact 一天后过期
And the artifact expires after a day,

251
00:14:12,278 --> 00:14:16,043
所以明天再重新运行一个失败的 job，会在下载那一步失败
so re-running a failed job tomorrow fails at the download.

252
00:14:16,283 --> 00:14:17,883
轮到你来预测
Your turn to predict.

253
00:14:17,968 --> 00:14:21,680
从 Unit Tests 这个 job 里删掉 Load Docker image 这一步
Delete the "Load Docker image" step from the unit tests job.

254
00:14:22,000 --> 00:14:24,241
哪一步会失败，报什么错？
Which step fails, and with what error?

255
00:14:33,083 --> 00:14:34,683
是 Run unit tests 这一步
The "Run unit tests" step.

256
00:14:34,939 --> 00:14:36,672
Docker 在这台机器上找 image
Docker looks for the image

257
00:14:36,672 --> 00:14:40,339
什么也没找到，再去问 Docker Hub
on the machine and finds nothing, then asks Docker Hub,

258
00:14:40,339 --> 00:14:43,472
那里也没有这个 image：pull access denied
where no such image exists: pull access denied.

259
00:14:43,792 --> 00:14:48,401
退出码 125：这个步骤失败，job 也就失败了
Exit code 125: the step fails, so the job fails.

260
00:14:49,950 --> 00:14:51,550
接下来是 lint and format
Next, lint and format.

261
00:14:51,827 --> 00:14:54,736
课上说的编码规范，在这里就是 Black
The lecture's coding standards are Black here,

262
00:14:54,736 --> 00:14:57,203
静态代码分析就是 Flake8
and its static code analysis is Flake8.

263
00:14:57,523 --> 00:15:02,771
还记得第 9 讲：格式化工具会改写你的代码；linter 只报告
Remember lecture 9: a formatter rewrites your code; a linter only reports.

264
00:15:03,017 --> 00:15:08,329
两个都在 image 里运行，查 api 目录，都是 120 列
Both run inside the image, on the api/ folder, at 120 columns.

265
00:15:08,649 --> 00:15:12,190
Black 这一步的 continue-on-error 写着 false：它会阻断
The Black step says continue-on-error, false: it blocks.

266
00:15:12,510 --> 00:15:14,356
Flake8 这一步写的是 true
The Flake8 step says true:

267
00:15:14,356 --> 00:15:17,907
它只提示，是一个永远不会让 job 失败的警告
it's advisory, a warning that never fails the job.

268
00:15:18,150 --> 00:15:19,750
一个步骤是怎么失败的？
How does a step fail?

269
00:15:19,857 --> 00:15:22,203
每条命令结束时都有一个退出码
Every command ends with an exit code.

270
00:15:22,523 --> 00:15:24,123
0 打开门禁
Zero opens the gate.

271
00:15:24,337 --> 00:15:29,051
其他任何值都会关上它，红色从步骤爬到 job，再爬到整个 run
Anything else shuts it, and the red climbs from the step to the job to the whole run.

272
00:15:29,300 --> 00:15:32,991
在 run 1 里，Black 这一步：would reformat utils.py
Run 1, the Black step: would reformat utils.py.

273
00:15:33,311 --> 00:15:35,188
1 file would be reformatted
1 file would be reformatted.

274
00:15:35,508 --> 00:15:37,748
退出码 1，门禁关上了
Exit code 1, so the gate shuts.

275
00:15:37,983 --> 00:15:40,138
步骤列表显示了接下来发生的事
The step list shows what happened next.

276
00:15:40,458 --> 00:15:41,858
Black，failure
Black, failure.

277
00:15:41,908 --> 00:15:43,480
Flake8，skipped
Flake8, skipped.

278
00:15:43,530 --> 00:15:48,031
失败步骤下面的步骤都不会运行，除非它们要求总是运行
The steps below a failed step don't run, unless they ask to run always.

279
00:15:48,267 --> 00:15:51,263
原因就是你在第 9 讲见过的那处乱糟糟的格式
The cause is the mess you met in lecture 9,

280
00:15:51,263 --> 00:15:53,701
它是故意留在 repo 里的
still in the repository on purpose:

281
00:15:53,701 --> 00:15:58,229
逗号后面少了一个空格，该空两行的地方空了三行
no space after the comma, and three blank lines where two belong.

282
00:15:58,467 --> 00:16:00,451
被跳过的 Flake8 本来会说什么？
What would the skipped Flake8 have said?

283
00:16:00,771 --> 00:16:04,056
一次额外运行在同样那几行上给出两个警告
An extra run shows two warnings on those same lines.

284
00:16:04,376 --> 00:16:08,216
但即使那样它也只是提示：决定 job 的只有 Black
But even then it's advisory: only Black decides the job.

285
00:16:08,450 --> 00:16:13,698
这就是全部规则：一个步骤失败，是因为它的命令以非 0 的值退出
So that's the whole rule: a step fails when its command exits with anything but zero.

286
00:16:14,018 --> 00:16:16,173
CI 只听这一样东西
It's the only thing CI listens to.

287
00:16:17,717 --> 00:16:19,139
现在看测试
Now the tests.

288
00:16:19,189 --> 00:16:25,248
课上那一个测试方框，在这里是三个并排的 job，各在不同的层级
The lecture's one test box is three jobs here, side by side, each at a different altitude.

289
00:16:25,484 --> 00:16:30,135
单元测试一次检查一个函数，不依赖外部
Unit tests check one function at a time, with no outside dependencies.

290
00:16:30,455 --> 00:16:33,569
日志里收集了 11 个测试，11 个都通过
The log collects 11 tests, and 11 pass.

291
00:16:33,817 --> 00:16:37,700
接着覆盖率那一步又跑了一遍，11 个又全部通过
Then the coverage step runs them again, and all 11 pass again.

292
00:16:38,020 --> 00:16:40,246
可是 pytest 碰到一个内部错误
But pytest hits an internal error:

293
00:16:40,246 --> 00:16:43,652
permission denied，写不进覆盖率目录
permission denied, writing into the coverage folder.

294
00:16:43,972 --> 00:16:45,350
退出码 3
Exit code 3.

295
00:16:45,400 --> 00:16:47,000
可这个 job 是绿的
Yet the job is green.

296
00:16:47,192 --> 00:16:51,053
这一步写着 continue-on-error，所以失败被旁路到一边
The step says continue-on-error, so the failure is shunted aside.

297
00:16:51,373 --> 00:16:54,778
然后标着 if always 的上传找不到文件
Then the upload, marked if: always(), finds no files;

298
00:16:54,778 --> 00:16:57,091
在 GitHub 上，会有一个黄色警告说明这一点
on GitHub, a yellow warning says so.

299
00:16:57,334 --> 00:17:03,073
README 有一个小缺口：它承诺有终端、XML 和 HTML 三种报告
The README has a small gap: it promises terminal, XML and HTML reports.

300
00:17:03,393 --> 00:17:06,529
Docker 以 root 身份建出缺失的覆盖率目录
Docker creates the missing coverage folder as root,

301
00:17:06,529 --> 00:17:09,665
而 container 的用户 app 写不进去
and the container's user, app, can't write into it.

302
00:17:09,985 --> 00:17:14,102
先把目录建成可写的；练习里有修复方法
Create the folder writable first; the exercises have the fix.

303
00:17:14,350 --> 00:17:17,851
集成测试用的是 FastAPI 的测试客户端
Integration tests use the FastAPI test client:

304
00:17:17,851 --> 00:17:21,582
应用在同一个 Python 进程里被调用
the app is called inside the same Python process.

305
00:17:21,902 --> 00:17:23,523
没有服务器，也没有 port
No server, no port.

306
00:17:23,843 --> 00:17:27,243
10 passed。系统测试要真家伙
10 passed. System tests need the real thing.

307
00:17:27,563 --> 00:17:33,174
一个 container 在后台启动服务器并发布 port 9000
One container starts the server in the background and publishes port 9000 on the runner.

308
00:17:33,494 --> 00:17:38,379
一条额外的命令 docker ps 显示它正在运行，9000 已经映射好了
An extra command, docker ps, shows it running, with 9000 mapped.

309
00:17:38,617 --> 00:17:44,441
然后 job 等 10 秒，用 curl -f 去敲 localhost:9000 的门
Then the job waits 10 seconds, and curl -f knocks on localhost:9000.

310
00:17:44,761 --> 00:17:48,708
只有欢迎消息回来了，下一道门禁才会打开
Only when the welcome message comes back does the next gate open.

311
00:17:48,950 --> 00:17:52,696
第二个 container 用 --network host 跑测试
A second container runs the tests with --network host:

312
00:17:52,696 --> 00:17:57,483
它共用 runner 的网络，所以 localhost:9000 能连到服务器
it shares the runner's network, so localhost:9000 reaches the server.

313
00:17:57,803 --> 00:17:59,084
5 passed
5 passed.

314
00:17:59,134 --> 00:18:01,819
最后是两个标着 if always 的步骤
Two steps marked if: always() come last,

315
00:18:01,819 --> 00:18:03,319
就算前面失败也会运行
even after a failure:

316
00:18:03,319 --> 00:18:06,853
显示服务器日志，每个测试请求都会到达那里
show the server log, where every test request arrives,

317
00:18:06,853 --> 00:18:09,203
然后停掉并删除 container
then stop and remove the container.

318
00:18:09,523 --> 00:18:12,104
这就是 README 说的条件执行
That's the README's conditional execution.

319
00:18:12,350 --> 00:18:16,275
在第 9 讲，没有服务器时这些测试会悄悄跳过
In lecture 9, a missing server made these tests skip quietly.

320
00:18:16,595 --> 00:18:19,476
在这里，curl 这道门禁让它大声地失败
Here the curl gate makes it fail loudly instead.

321
00:18:21,117 --> 00:18:27,240
最后一个 job：汇总，课上说它收集结果，报告通过还是失败
Last job: the summary, which the lecture says collects the results and reports pass or fail.

322
00:18:27,560 --> 00:18:30,034
它的 needs 那一行写的是三个测试 job
Its needs line names the three test jobs.

323
00:18:30,354 --> 00:18:33,929
而 if always 让它就算其中一个失败了也照样运行
And if: always() lets it run even when one of them failed:

324
00:18:33,929 --> 00:18:36,456
它会运行，但运行不等于通过
it runs, which isn't the same as passing.

325
00:18:36,700 --> 00:18:39,121
它的脚本打印每个 job 的结果
Its script prints each job's result,

326
00:18:39,121 --> 00:18:42,484
把一个状态写进 GitHub output 留给后面的步骤
writes a status to $GITHUB_OUTPUT for later steps,

327
00:18:42,484 --> 00:18:45,511
并以 1 退出，只要有任何一个结果不是 success
and exits with 1 if any result isn't success.

328
00:18:45,750 --> 00:18:48,625
在 run 1 里，到来的是三个 success
In run 1, three success tokens arrive:

329
00:18:48,625 --> 00:18:50,593
unit、integration、system
unit, integration, system.

330
00:18:50,913 --> 00:18:52,400
All tests passed
All tests passed.

331
00:18:52,450 --> 00:18:54,285
开头那个谜题，现在有答案了
And here is the hook, answered.

332
00:18:54,605 --> 00:18:58,359
这个 lint 不在 needs 里，所以它的失败永远到不了汇总
Lint isn't in needs, so its failure never reaches the summary.

333
00:18:58,679 --> 00:18:59,957
这个 run 还是红的
The run is still red,

334
00:18:59,957 --> 00:19:02,818
因为任何一个失败的 job 都会让整个 run 变红
because any failed job turns the whole run red.

335
00:19:03,067 --> 00:19:07,151
README 说汇总检查所有测试 job 的结果
The README says the summary checks the results of all test jobs,

336
00:19:07,151 --> 00:19:10,278
字面上这没错：lint 不是测试 job
and that's literally true: lint isn't a test job.

337
00:19:10,598 --> 00:19:13,251
把 lint and format 加进 needs 和检查里
Add lint and format to needs and to the check

338
00:19:13,251 --> 00:19:14,800
如果你想让它算数的话
if you want it counted.

339
00:19:14,850 --> 00:19:16,450
现在来看课上那个 bug
Now the bug from class.

340
00:19:16,663 --> 00:19:18,163
在演示 commit 里
In the demo commit,

341
00:19:18,163 --> 00:19:22,338
距离函数取的是 2 乘 z 的平方根，而不是 z 的
the distance function takes the square root of 2 times z, instead of z.

342
00:19:22,658 --> 00:19:24,877
这次我们替你跑过了：你只看就行
We ran this one for you: just watch.

343
00:19:25,117 --> 00:19:26,717
先预测，再看 run
Predict before the run.

344
00:19:26,866 --> 00:19:30,216
现在哪些 job 会变红，Test Summary 又会说什么？
Which jobs turn red now, and what does Test Summary say?

345
00:19:39,050 --> 00:19:42,143
Integration：红，1 failed，9 passed
Integration: red, 1 failed and 9 passed.

346
00:19:42,463 --> 00:19:46,432
3 和 4 的距离回来的是大约 7，不是 5
The distance for 3 and 4 came back as about 7, not 5.

347
00:19:46,667 --> 00:19:49,093
System：红，2 failed，3 passed
System: red, 2 failed and 3 passed:

348
00:19:49,093 --> 00:19:54,710
又是 3 和 4，还有默认点 1 和 2，回来的结果也太大了
3 and 4 again, and the default point, 1 and 2, which came back too large as well.

349
00:19:55,030 --> 00:19:59,104
Unit：绿，因为只有 power 函数有单元测试
Unit: green, because only the power function has unit tests.

350
00:19:59,424 --> 00:20:02,198
Lint：照样红，因为 utils.py
Lint: red anyway, for utils.py.

351
00:20:02,434 --> 00:20:06,061
而汇总现在说有测试失败了，并以 1 退出
And the summary now says some tests failed, and exits with 1.

352
00:20:06,381 --> 00:20:08,087
这一次，汇总听见了
This time the summary heard it.

353
00:20:09,633 --> 00:20:11,894
回到 run 1，还有课上那个循环
Back to run 1 and the lecture's loop.

354
00:20:12,214 --> 00:20:17,643
通知回来是红的，所以现在开发者修代码
The notification came back red, so now the developer fixes the code and commits again,

355
00:20:17,643 --> 00:20:19,852
再 commit 一次，循环再转一圈
and the loop goes around once more.

356
00:20:20,100 --> 00:20:24,338
修复用的是第 9 讲的工具，同一个 README 的 Part 4
The fix is the tool from lecture 9, Part 4 of the same README,

357
00:20:24,338 --> 00:20:26,457
所以这些步骤在这里是额外的
so these steps are extras here.

358
00:20:26,777 --> 00:20:29,959
先 pip install pre-commit，再 pre-commit install
pip install pre-commit, then pre-commit install,

359
00:20:29,959 --> 00:20:32,345
它把 hook 放进 .git/hooks
which puts the hook into .git/hooks.

360
00:20:32,583 --> 00:20:34,738
然后跑 pre-commit run --all-files
Then pre-commit run --all-files.

361
00:20:35,058 --> 00:20:36,856
卫生检查都通过
The hygiene checks pass;

362
00:20:36,856 --> 00:20:41,500
Black 失败了，因为它改了一个文件：reformatted utils.py
Black fails, because it modified a file: reformatted utils.py.

363
00:20:41,820 --> 00:20:43,420
接着 Flake8 通过了
Flake8 then passes.

364
00:20:43,719 --> 00:20:45,066
暂停一下，自己跑一遍
Pause and run it.

365
00:20:45,116 --> 00:20:47,972
用 git diff 能看到 Black 到底改了什么
git diff shows exactly what Black changed:

366
00:20:47,972 --> 00:20:51,303
逗号后面加了空格，删掉了一个空行
a space after the comma, and one blank line gone.

367
00:20:51,550 --> 00:20:53,790
再跑一遍，所有 hook 都通过
Run it again, and every hook passes.

368
00:20:54,110 --> 00:20:55,731
没有要修的了
Nothing is left to fix.

369
00:20:56,150 --> 00:20:59,577
现在 git add .，再 git commit，写上信息
Now git add ., and git commit with a message:

370
00:20:59,577 --> 00:21:01,633
Format utils.py with Black
Format utils.py with Black.

371
00:21:01,953 --> 00:21:04,598
这条信息是我们写的；README 里没有
The message is ours; the README has none.

372
00:21:04,918 --> 00:21:07,107
这些 hook 在 commit 时运行，都通过了
The hooks run on the commit and pass.

373
00:21:07,158 --> 00:21:08,580
然后 git push
Then git push.

374
00:21:08,630 --> 00:21:10,230
暂停一下，push 你自己的
Pause and push yours.

375
00:21:10,300 --> 00:21:12,113
再看 run 2：六个全绿
Run 2: all six green.

376
00:21:12,433 --> 00:21:14,426
在 lint 这个 job 里，Black 满意了
In the lint job, Black is happy,

377
00:21:14,426 --> 00:21:17,041
这一次 Flake8 也跑了，而且通过了
and this time Flake8 runs too, and passes.

378
00:21:17,361 --> 00:21:20,284
在 fork 上，这是你的第一个 run，而且是绿的
On a fork, this is your first run, and it's green.

379
00:21:20,533 --> 00:21:23,242
现在你的 run 和 README 的截图一样了
Now your run matches the README's screenshot.

380
00:21:23,562 --> 00:21:26,972
循环转了一圈：一个红色的通知，一次修复
One turn of the loop: a red notification, a fix, a commit,

381
00:21:26,972 --> 00:21:28,572
一个 commit，一个绿色的 run
and a green run.

382
00:21:29,983 --> 00:21:32,735
课上把这个叫作本地难题
The lecture calls this one the local conundrum.

383
00:21:33,055 --> 00:21:35,376
如果 hook 已经在你的笔记本上跑过了
If the hooks already ran on your laptop,

384
00:21:35,376 --> 00:21:37,812
为什么还要在服务器上再跑一遍同样的检查？
why run the same checks again on a server?

385
00:21:38,050 --> 00:21:40,845
这些步骤都是额外的，你只看就行
These steps are extras, and you can just watch.

386
00:21:41,165 --> 00:21:45,382
快速改一下，把 service.py 里一行的空格挤掉
A quick edit squeezes the spaces out of one line in service.py,

387
00:21:45,382 --> 00:21:46,982
git diff 能看到
and git diff shows it.

388
00:21:47,116 --> 00:21:50,316
先 git add .，再 git commit -m "quick fix"
git add ., then git commit -m "quick fix".

389
00:21:50,636 --> 00:21:53,165
Black 这个 hook 失败了，并重新格式化了文件
The Black hook fails and reformats the file,

390
00:21:53,165 --> 00:21:54,946
所以 hook 拦下了这次 commit
so the hook stopped the commit.

391
00:21:55,883 --> 00:21:59,766
用 git status --short 看，显示两个字母 M，表示已修改
git status --short shows the letter M, for modified, twice.

392
00:22:00,086 --> 00:22:04,438
Black 修好了你工作区里的文件，但暂存的那份还是乱的
Black fixed your working copy, but the staged copy is still the messy one.

393
00:22:04,683 --> 00:22:06,607
现在是课上那条命令
Now the lecture's command:

394
00:22:06,607 --> 00:22:09,419
git commit --no-verify -m "quick fix"
git commit --no-verify -m "quick fix".

395
00:22:09,739 --> 00:22:12,058
没有任何 hook 运行，commit 也生成了
No hook ran, and the commit exists:

396
00:22:12,058 --> 00:22:14,774
--no-verify 跳过了所有 pre-commit 检查
--no-verify skips every pre-commit check.

397
00:22:15,050 --> 00:22:16,259
我们把它 push 上去
We push it.

398
00:22:16,309 --> 00:22:19,786
再看 run 3：lint and format 红了，因为 service.py
Run 3: lint and format, red, on service.py.

399
00:22:20,106 --> 00:22:22,218
测试和汇总全都通过
The tests and the summary all pass.

400
00:22:22,883 --> 00:22:26,104
被跳过的 Flake8 本来会把那一行标出三次
The skipped Flake8 would have flagged that line three times.

401
00:22:26,424 --> 00:22:29,312
被 --no-verify 放过去的，CI 抓住了
CI caught what --no-verify let through:

402
00:22:29,312 --> 00:22:31,310
课件第 31 页，就在你的终端里
slide 31, at your terminal.

403
00:22:31,550 --> 00:22:33,150
收拾一下这个实验
Clean up the experiment.

404
00:22:33,363 --> 00:22:37,651
在这里，git restore 只是扔掉了工作区里 Black 的修复
Here, git restore only throws away Black's fix in the working copy.

405
00:22:37,971 --> 00:22:41,551
如果你跟着做了，那个乱的 commit 现在就在你的 main 上
If you followed along, the messy commit is on your main now,

406
00:22:41,551 --> 00:22:43,987
不管 push 了没有。还没 push？
pushed or not. Not pushed yet?

407
00:22:44,307 --> 00:22:48,340
用 git reset --hard HEAD~1 把它去掉。已经 push 了？
git reset --hard HEAD~1 drops it. Pushed?

408
00:22:48,595 --> 00:22:52,728
先跑 pre-commit run --all-files，再 add、commit、push
Run pre-commit run --all-files, then add, commit and push,

409
00:22:52,728 --> 00:22:54,050
然后再做 Part 6
before part 6.

410
00:22:54,100 --> 00:22:59,092
但 CI 只重复 Black 和 Flake8，而且只查 api 目录
But CI repeats only Black and Flake8, and only on the api/ folder.

411
00:22:59,412 --> 00:23:02,474
七个卫生检查 hook 在 CI 里从来不跑
The seven hygiene hooks never run in CI:

412
00:23:02,474 --> 00:23:09,438
行尾空白、文件结尾、YAML、大文件、JSON、合并冲突标记和私钥
trailing whitespace, end of file, YAML, large files, JSON, merge markers, and private keys.

413
00:23:09,683 --> 00:23:13,608
还有一个缺口：hook pin 住的 Black 比 image 里装的旧
One more gap: the hooks pin an older Black than the image installs.

414
00:23:13,928 --> 00:23:17,683
录制时它们是一致的，但可能会慢慢分开
At the time of recording they agreed, but they can drift apart.

415
00:23:17,933 --> 00:23:21,225
一个队友用 --no-verify commit 了一个私钥文件
A teammate commits a private key file with --no-verify

416
00:23:21,225 --> 00:23:22,790
还 push 到了 main
and pushes to main.

417
00:23:22,840 --> 00:23:25,058
这条 pipeline 里哪个 job 能抓住它？
Which job of this pipeline catches it?

418
00:23:33,900 --> 00:23:37,740
一个也没有。这个 detect-private-key 只是本地 hook
None. The detect-private-key hook is a local hook only.

419
00:23:38,060 --> 00:23:41,690
解决办法是加一个 CI 步骤，pre-commit run --all-files
The fix is one CI step, pre-commit run --all-files:

420
00:23:41,690 --> 00:23:46,316
正是课上设想的那条 Slack 消息里失败的那一步
the very step that fails on the lecture's imagined Slack message.

421
00:23:46,636 --> 00:23:49,388
还要轮换那个密钥；它已经在 GitHub 上了
And rotate that key; it's already on GitHub.

422
00:23:50,733 --> 00:23:54,466
那条设想中的消息，把我们带回课上的 webhook
That imagined message brings us back to the lecture's webhooks.

423
00:23:54,786 --> 00:23:58,108
所谓 webhook，就是 GitHub 去调用一个外部地址
A webhook is GitHub calling an outside address

424
00:23:58,108 --> 00:24:03,163
在发生某件事的时候：用来启动像 Jenkins 这样的外部 CI 系统
when something happens: to start an outside CI system such as Jenkins,

425
00:24:03,163 --> 00:24:05,474
用来部署，或者往聊天工具里发消息
to deploy, or to post to a chat.

426
00:24:05,716 --> 00:24:09,257
这部分是可选的：需要你自己的 Slack 工作区
This part is optional: it needs your own Slack workspace.

427
00:24:09,577 --> 00:24:12,009
而这个 webhook 的方向是反过来的
And this webhook works the other way round.

428
00:24:12,329 --> 00:24:15,267
Slack 给你一个 incoming webhook，也就是一个地址
Slack gives you an incoming webhook, an address,

429
00:24:15,267 --> 00:24:18,388
Test Summary 这个 job 的最后几步去调用它
and the last steps of the test summary job call it.

430
00:24:18,708 --> 00:24:21,588
GitHub 不打这个铃；打铃的是你的工作流
GitHub doesn't ring this bell; your workflow does.

431
00:24:21,833 --> 00:24:27,005
课上设想的是一个 Slack 频道，每次 push 都会收到通知
The lecture imagines a Slack channel told about every push, failures included,

432
00:24:27,005 --> 00:24:29,790
失败也包括在内，还附上失败的步骤、数量和耗时
with the failed step, counts and duration.

433
00:24:30,110 --> 00:24:34,142
这个工作流发的少一些：通过还是失败、repo、分支、commit
This workflow sends less: passed or failed, the repository,

434
00:24:34,142 --> 00:24:38,516
和作者、每个测试 job 一个标记，还有两个链接
branch, commit and author, one mark per test job, and two links.

435
00:24:38,750 --> 00:24:40,734
这个 webhook 地址是一个 secret
The webhook address is a secret.

436
00:24:41,054 --> 00:24:45,109
在 Settings，Secrets and variables，Actions 下面
Add it under Settings → Secrets and variables → Actions,

437
00:24:45,109 --> 00:24:48,770
加一个名叫 Slack webhook URL 的新仓库 secret
as a new repository secret named SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL,

438
00:24:48,770 --> 00:24:50,370
别加在 Webhooks 页面里
not under Webhooks.

439
00:24:50,590 --> 00:24:54,387
它永远不进 repo，日志里显示成三个星号
It never goes in the repository, logs show it as ***,

440
00:24:54,387 --> 00:24:57,395
来自 fork 的 PR 拿不到它
and pull requests from forks don't get it.

441
00:24:57,633 --> 00:25:00,345
检查那一步看有没有设这个 secret
The check step tests whether the secret is set,

442
00:25:00,345 --> 00:25:02,710
然后写下 enabled 为 true 或 false
and writes enabled=true or enabled=false.

443
00:25:03,030 --> 00:25:05,505
为什么不直接在 if 那一行里测这个 secret？
Why not test the secret right in the if line?

444
00:25:05,825 --> 00:25:08,012
GitHub 不允许在那里用 secret
GitHub doesn't allow secrets there;

445
00:25:08,012 --> 00:25:12,822
这个 repo 自己的历史里就试过，后来换成了这个 shell 检查
the repository's own history tried it, and replaced it with this shell check.

446
00:25:13,066 --> 00:25:16,149
在 run 1 里没有 secret，所以 enabled 为 false
In run 1 there's no secret, so enabled is false,

447
00:25:16,149 --> 00:25:19,168
Slack 那一步被跳过，本该如此
and the Slack step is skipped, as it should be.

448
00:25:19,416 --> 00:25:20,966
再看演示 commit 那次 run
Now the demo run.

449
00:25:21,016 --> 00:25:22,723
Check test results 失败了
Check test results fails.

450
00:25:23,043 --> 00:25:26,484
检查那一步没有 if always，所以它也被跳过
The check step has no if: always(), so it's skipped too,

451
00:25:26,484 --> 00:25:30,232
enabled 一直是空的，Slack 那一步的条件就是 false
enabled stays empty, and the Slack step's condition is false.

452
00:25:30,466 --> 00:25:33,197
照现在这样写，这只铃只在有好消息时才响
As written, the bell only rings for good news.

453
00:25:33,517 --> 00:25:36,695
修复只要一行：在检查那一步加上 if always
The fix is one line: if: always(), on the check step.

454
00:25:37,015 --> 00:25:39,554
练习里有一个加固版
The exercises have a hardened version.

455
00:25:40,900 --> 00:25:44,676
README 的 Part 6 是可选的，它就是课上说的门禁
Part 6 of the README is optional, and it's the lecture's gate.

456
00:25:44,996 --> 00:25:47,727
由 push 触发的 run，就是 post-receive 这只铃
A push-triggered run is the post-receive bell.

457
00:25:48,047 --> 00:25:52,248
在 GitHub.com 上，会拒绝的那道门禁是分支保护
On GitHub.com, the gate that refuses is branch protection,

458
00:25:52,248 --> 00:25:54,276
加上必需的状态检查
with required status checks.

459
00:25:54,517 --> 00:25:57,632
打开 Settings 里的 Branches，给 main 加一条规则
Go to Settings → Branches, and add a rule for main.

460
00:25:57,952 --> 00:26:01,102
勾上这两项：Require a pull request before merging
Tick the boxes "Require a pull request before merging",

461
00:26:01,102 --> 00:26:04,074
还有 Require status checks to pass before merging
and "Require status checks to pass before merging".

462
00:26:04,124 --> 00:26:08,234
现在的页面可能叫它 classic 规则，或者改成提供 rulesets
Today's page may call it a classic rule, or offer rulesets instead.

463
00:26:08,483 --> 00:26:10,054
然后选出要用的检查
Then pick the checks.

464
00:26:10,104 --> 00:26:13,721
有一个小疏漏：选择列表按名字列出 job
A small slip: the picker lists jobs by their names,

465
00:26:13,721 --> 00:26:16,690
比如 Lint and Format Check 和 Unit Tests
like Lint and Format Check and Unit Tests,

466
00:26:16,690 --> 00:26:18,290
而不是 README 里的 ID
not the README's IDs.

467
00:26:18,510 --> 00:26:20,707
它们要在最近跑过一次 run 之后才会出现
They appear only after a recent run.

468
00:26:21,027 --> 00:26:24,227
在私有 repo 上，这需要付费套餐
On a private repository this needs a paid plan.

469
00:26:24,467 --> 00:26:28,542
然后测试一下：git checkout -b feature/test-protection
Then test it: git checkout -b feature/test-protection.

470
00:26:28,862 --> 00:26:32,647
单单 push 这个分支，什么也不会启动，触发条件那里你看到过
Pushing that branch starts nothing, as you saw with the triggers;

471
00:26:32,647 --> 00:26:35,325
run 在你打开 PR 时才开始
the run starts when you open the pull request.

472
00:26:35,567 --> 00:26:39,556
README 通过追加 def broken，assert False 来弄坏测试
The README breaks the tests by appending def broken(): assert False.

473
00:26:39,876 --> 00:26:43,077
在 image 里额外跑一次，结果还是 11 passed
An extra run in the image still says 11 passed,

474
00:26:43,077 --> 00:26:47,641
因为 pytest 只收集名字以 test 开头的函数
because pytest only collects functions whose names start with test.

475
00:26:47,883 --> 00:26:51,019
所以改名叫 test 下划线 broken，这是一个额外的修复
So name it test_broken instead, an extra fix.

476
00:26:51,339 --> 00:26:53,366
现在是 1 failed，11 passed
Now 1 failed and 11 passed.

477
00:26:53,686 --> 00:26:57,810
就是它让 PR 变红；开着保护
That's the one that turns the pull request red, and with protection on,

478
00:26:57,810 --> 00:26:59,553
合并按钮就一直锁着
the merge button stays locked.

479
00:26:59,800 --> 00:27:01,300
然后 git add .
Then git add .,

480
00:27:01,300 --> 00:27:03,893
git commit -m "Intentionally break tests"
git commit -m "Intentionally break tests",

481
00:27:03,893 --> 00:27:07,053
再 git push origin feature/test-protection
and git push origin feature/test-protection.

482
00:27:07,373 --> 00:27:12,323
在 GitHub 上打开 PR：测试通过之前，合并一直是锁着的
Open the pull request on GitHub: the merge stays locked until the tests pass.

483
00:27:12,643 --> 00:27:14,676
暂停一下，在你自己的 repo 上试一试
Pause and try it on yours.

484
00:27:14,726 --> 00:27:17,293
在这里，用 git checkout -- 把测试文件还原
Here, git checkout -- puts the test file back.

485
00:27:18,433 --> 00:27:24,620
课上许诺的转折：不确定性会进入每一个阶段，只要代码要训练模型
The twist the lecture promised: non-determinism enters every stage when the code trains a model.

486
00:27:24,940 --> 00:27:27,170
课上的答案是：一切都做版本管理
Its answers: version everything;

487
00:27:27,170 --> 00:27:31,351
自动化重新训练和测试，Milestone 5 就要求这个
automate retraining and testing, which Milestone 5 asks for;

488
00:27:31,351 --> 00:27:33,580
监控；还有谨慎上线
monitor; and roll out with care.

489
00:27:33,816 --> 00:27:40,067
持续部署是课上最后一节，它把发布自动化：那是第 23 讲
Continuous deployment, the lecture's last section, automates the release: that's lecture 23.

490
00:27:40,316 --> 00:27:44,303
收尾清理：切回 main，删掉 feature/test-protection 分支
Clean up: switch to main, and delete the feature/test-protection branch here

491
00:27:44,303 --> 00:27:45,803
这里和 GitHub 上都要删
and on GitHub;

492
00:27:45,803 --> 00:27:47,591
这样它的 PR 也就关闭了
that closes its pull request.

493
00:27:47,911 --> 00:27:49,217
把分支规则删掉
Remove the branch rule,

494
00:27:49,217 --> 00:27:52,113
还有 Slack 的 secret 和 webhook，如果你建了的话
and the Slack secret and webhook, if you made them.

495
00:27:52,433 --> 00:27:55,281
在私有 repo 上就停用这个工作流
Disable the workflow on a private repository,

496
00:27:55,281 --> 00:27:57,938
再跑一遍第 9 讲的 Docker 清理
and run the Docker cleanup from lecture 9.

497
00:27:58,183 --> 00:27:59,712
再看一遍循环
Once more, the loop.

498
00:27:59,762 --> 00:28:01,362
你的 push 就是事件
Your push is the event.

499
00:28:01,554 --> 00:28:03,533
每个 job 都有一台全新的机器
Each job gets a fresh machine,

500
00:28:03,533 --> 00:28:05,906
所以 image 要作为 artifact 来传
so the image travels as an artifact.

501
00:28:06,226 --> 00:28:09,170
每个步骤都是一道门禁，读的是退出码
Every step is a gate that reads an exit code,

502
00:28:09,170 --> 00:28:12,114
而汇总只听它 needs 里的 job
and the summary hears only the jobs it needs.

503
00:28:12,350 --> 00:28:14,291
自测一下，每道题都暂停想一想
Test yourself, pausing on each.

504
00:28:14,611 --> 00:28:18,096
第一题：说出代码进到共享 repo 的两种方式
One: name two ways code reaches the shared repository

505
00:28:18,096 --> 00:28:20,265
而且都不经过你的本地 hook
without passing your local hooks.

506
00:28:20,585 --> 00:28:22,739
这条 pipeline 重复了哪些检查？
Which checks does this pipeline repeat?

507
00:28:22,983 --> 00:28:26,588
第二题：分到一台全新机器的单位是哪个，job 还是步骤？
Two: which unit gets a fresh machine, a job or a step?

508
00:28:26,908 --> 00:28:30,172
为什么这就逼得每个检查 job 里都得做一次 docker load？
And why does that force a docker load in every check job?

509
00:28:30,416 --> 00:28:34,384
第三题：你的 run 是红的，但汇总说所有测试都通过了
Three: your run is red, but the summary says all tests passed.

510
00:28:34,704 --> 00:28:36,966
为什么会这样，那一行的修复又是什么？
Why, and what is the one-line fix?

511
00:28:37,200 --> 00:28:40,825
第四题：为什么 Flake8 失败了，它的 job 却不会失败
Four: why can Flake8 fail without failing its job, and why

512
00:28:40,825 --> 00:28:43,450
Black 失败时，你又为什么看不到它的输出？
don't you see its output when Black fails?

513
00:28:44,183 --> 00:28:46,872
第五题：由 push 触发的 run 是 pre-receive 检查
Five: is a push-triggered run a pre-receive

514
00:28:46,872 --> 00:28:49,751
还是 post-receive 检查，又是什么让它成为门禁？
or a post-receive check, and what makes it a gate?

515
00:28:50,071 --> 00:28:53,250
答案在练习和学习指南里
Answers are in the exercises and the study guide.
